{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/e06238d803e788b45ece42cc0ca79cb7.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/e06238d803e788b45ece42cc0ca79cb7.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of <i>economic strategy</i>, <i>city builder</i>, <i>tycoon</i> and <i>city survival</i> game where top football clubs entrust you with organising their matches. Manage the city, its stadium, and different type of fan communities to create a football event the world will remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copa City</strong> is the first game where you\u2019re the organiser of major football events. Your road to glory begins 14 days before the referee\u2019s first whistle and concludes with its sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/882fee3c00a09ce7851b9ee161dcc832.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/882fee3c00a09ce7851b9ee161dcc832.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real world cities become your playground. Berlin and Warsaw each come with their own districts, transport layouts, and cultural specifics that directly shape the way you play \u2014 offering distinct challenges, moods, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fan zones, expand infrastructure, plan transport routes, and balance fan excitement with the needs of local residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Copa City, <strong>the entire city becomes both: your playground and place of business.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/af8ff26938ce2eff6eefe5611b5e19c4.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/af8ff26938ce2eff6eefe5611b5e19c4.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deep yet accessible management system built around three key resources:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funds</strong> - invest wisely in operations, infrastructure, human resources and marketing campaigns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialists</strong> - hire professionals with unique abilities to operate in your fan zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Volunteers</strong> - engage the local community for extra support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make \u2014 matters. From the placement of fan areas to responding to sudden mood shifts among fans and locals, transport breakdowns, or growing expectations from different supporter groups. At the same time, you\u2019ll be managing three distinct fan groups, each with their own expectations and behaviours:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultras</strong> - passionate and unpredictable; they demand space for expression and visible club presence across the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Supporters</strong> - the heartbeat of every matchday; they seek access to merchandise, food, and authentic fan experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Families</strong> - value comfort, safety, and a festive atmosphere that celebrates football without chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing these groups, territories, and priorities is the key to <strong>achieving maximum Match Readiness and filling up the stadium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/105189936ab27414874719acffc2f25e.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/105189936ab27414874719acffc2f25e.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six legendary clubs. Among them: Borussia Dortmund, FC Bayern M\u00fcnchen, Arsenal FC, CR Flamengo, Be\u015fikta\u015f JK and one more which is yet to be revealed - each bring their own philosophy, fan culture, and expectations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Borussia Dortmund</strong> - recreate the energy of the Yellow Wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FC Bayern M\u00fcnchen</strong> - honour the pride of Mia san mia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal FC</strong> - create an event in the spirit of North London football</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CR Flamengo</strong> - bring carnival to your city streets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be\u015fikta\u015f JK</strong> - embrace passion of Black Eagles and the thunder of the crowd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each partnership challenges you to understand and celebrate authentic fan traditions while maintaining order and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/d1e0c3acb21fd9a39223f32a099a0f4d.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/d1e0c3acb21fd9a39223f32a099a0f4d.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control over every stage of matchday preparation \u2014 and guide your event through an official match inspection that evaluates the safety, logistics, and readiness of your stadium operations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch ticket sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect the pitch and locker rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange media zones and press access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design fan sectors and safety buffers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategic planning \u2014 from infrastructure to inspection \u2014 shapes the roar of the stands when the teams step onto the pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/0c28eafd9f0dc15c1817a7b1c6c3c769.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/0c28eafd9f0dc15c1817a7b1c6c3c769.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As matchday approaches, <strong>the city comes alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan zones light up with colours, chants echo through the streets, families celebrate, and ultras ignite the atmosphere with flares and songs. When thousands of supporters march through your meticulously planned routes, filling the stands in a rising wave of colour and sound \u2014 that\u2019s when you feel the true pride of a City Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the match itself happens off-screen, the triumphant roar of the crowd is your victory \u2014 the final echo of the event you built from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/0cd429868032dd6bf2d432dea564a205.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=770 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/0cd429868032dd6bf2d432dea564a205.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road to Recognition Campaign</strong> - grow from local events to international match prep under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Match Mode</strong> - host matches across three unique cities with their dedicated stadiums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong> - unique scenarios with special victory conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY COPA CITY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 A fresh blend of city builder, strategy, and football management<br> \u2714 Official licences and authentic fan cultures<br> \u2714 Dynamic city systems and resource management<br> \u2714 Immersive yet relaxing gameplay without micromanagement - easy to play &amp; hard to master</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2210520?t=1764074946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764074946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/7cf105deecc355f95a2729dddd78ba1d280c5607/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764074946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/7cf105deecc355f95a2729dddd78ba1d280c5607/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764074946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Follow Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/04ed92937f837fee3462f04025e3ab95.poster.avif?t=1764074946\" width=764 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/04ed92937f837fee3462f04025e3ab95.webm?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/04ed92937f837fee3462f04025e3ab95.mp4?t=1764074946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Official Licensed Partners</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210520/extras/b2752a6772b879cbbee0c26f6e9cd320.avif?t=1764074946\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\